{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_016mWv3dsrxoN7jpLBkaoQzP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013dCoDhP2GwKDpbeBeqCfEc","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex","new_string":"## sos_57 — Mana Sculpt\n- Added `card.mana_spent` (effective cost cmc) at cast time in `cast_spell`,\n  the \"amount of mana spent to cast\" a spell (parallels `colors_spent`).\n- \"If you control a Wizard\" is checked at the delayed trigger's FIRE time\n  (your next precombat main), per TODO — not at Mana Sculpt's resolution.\n  Delayed mana rides on E2; it self-unregisters after one payout.\n- \"Your next main phase\" is modeled as your next precombat main (E2 only\n  fires there). Casting it during the opponent's turn pays out next turn;\n  casting earlier in your own turn pays at that turn's precombat main entry.\n\n## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":494,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1758,"cache_read_input_tokens":314213,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1758},"output_tokens":54,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce88d08d-e354-48ee-a9e8-a33d7aea2b51","uuid":"e19088fc-b1c3-41fd-b03c-de3cbea6d2b6","request_id":"req_011CbvjMyzPiywVXyuguaS1P"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013dCoDhP2GwKDpbeBeqCfEc","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce88d08d-e354-48ee-a9e8-a33d7aea2b51","uuid":"e6dd721c-4567-49b3-ac69-e680d6216cdb","timestamp":"2026-06-11T03:04:41.515Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex","newString":"## sos_57 — Mana Sculpt\n- Added `card.mana_spent` (effective cost cmc) at cast time in `cast_spell`,\n  the \"amount of mana spent to cast\" a spell (parallels `colors_spent`).\n- \"If you control a Wizard\" is checked at the delayed trigger's FIRE time\n  (your next precombat main), per TODO — not at Mana Sculpt's resolution.\n  Delayed mana rides on E2; it self-unregisters after one payout.\n- \"Your next main phase\" is modeled as your next precombat main (E2 only\n  fires there). Casting it during the opponent's turn pays out next turn;\n  casting earlier in your own turn pays at that turn's precombat main entry.\n\n## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex","originalFile":"# KEY_DECISIONS — SOS implementation run\n\nLightweight log of ambiguities, deviations from TODO.md, and deliberate\ncard-local engine limitations.\n\n## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n- Restricted mana (gap): added a separate `_restricted` track to `ManaPool`\n  plus an `allow_restricted` flag on `can_pay`/`pay`; `cast_spell` passes it\n  based on whether the spell is an instant/sorcery. Ability costs (the {5})\n  pay with `allow_restricted=False`, since activating an ability is not\n  \"casting a spell\". Unrestricted mana is spent before restricted.\n- Animation (gap): the land mutates in place (adds CREATURE type, Wizard\n  subtype, base 2/4, registers the pump trigger). `_reset_characteristics`\n  is overridden to NOT call super (which would de-animate by reverting\n  card_types) and to reset only the until-EOT pump. The EOT pump reset rides\n  on `EffectManager.apply_all`, which the engine runs during cleanup.\n- P/T while animated is exposed via `power`/`toughness` properties that\n  return 0 when not a creature (so a non-animated land isn't a combatant).\n\n## sos_226 — Silverquill, the Disputant\n- Casualty copy keeps the original spell's targets (the \"you may choose new\n  targets\" option is not prompted) — deliberate simplification; the copy\n  mechanic itself is faithful and the copy is correctly not re-cast (E1 does\n  not re-fire for copies).\n\n## sos_1 — The Dawning Archaic\n- Engine gap: `_resolve_spell` never consulted replacement effects for a\n  spell going stack→graveyard, and `AttacksTriggeredEvent` was defined but\n  never fired. Added both as small additive engine changes: a new\n  `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` consulted in `_resolve_spell`, and\n  per-attacker `AttacksTriggeredEvent` firing in `declare_attackers_step`.\n  Both are general (reusable) wirings of pre-existing event types, not a\n  one-card subsystem.\n- The \"may cast\" attack trigger auto-selects when exactly one legal target\n  exists (per TODO); with multiple, the controller chooses (None declines).\n  Declining a single legal target is not modeled — deliberate per plan.\n- The exile-instead replacement is one-shot, scoped to the specific spell\n  object, and self-unregisters when it fires. A countered free-cast spell\n  (which bypasses `_resolve_spell`) would not be redirected — edge case left\n  as a deliberate limitation.\n\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":3,"oldLines":6,"newStart":3,"newLines":16,"lines":[" Lightweight log of ambiguities, deviations from TODO.md, and deliberate"," card-local engine limitations."," ","+## sos_57 — Mana Sculpt","+- Added `card.mana_spent` (effective cost cmc) at cast time in `cast_spell`,","+  the \"amount of mana spent to cast\" a spell (parallels `colors_spent`).","+- \"If you control a Wizard\" is checked at the delayed trigger's FIRE time","+  (your next precombat main), per TODO — not at Mana Sculpt's resolution.","+  Delayed mana rides on E2; it self-unregisters after one payout.","+- \"Your next main phase\" is modeled as your next precombat main (E2 only","+  fires there). Casting it during the opponent's turn pays out next turn;","+  casting earlier in your own turn pays at that turn's precombat main entry.","+"," ## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex"," - Restricted mana (gap): added a separate `_restricted` track to `ManaPool`","   plus an `allow_restricted` flag on `can_pay`/`pay`; `cast_spell` passes it"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
