{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_014HZJm7EXsJbqAoPVYdbAN6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CgNGWJqwsTaxQG63U7jDcf","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"## sos_57 — Mana Sculpt","new_string":"## sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone\n- \"Cast a copy from exile\" (Paradigm) is implemented by shallow-copying the\n  exiled original, marking it `_is_paradigm_copy` (so it skips Paradigm setup\n  and isn't re-exiled), and free-casting it from exile. The original stays in\n  exile as the permanent home; copies go to the graveyard. Reuses the\n  `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` seam (added for sos_1) to exile the\n  original instead of sending it to the graveyard.\n- \"First main phase\" = your precombat main; the recurring trigger fires on E2\n  whenever you're the active player (recurring, never unregisters).\n\n## sos_57 — Mana Sculpt"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":964,"cache_read_input_tokens":340517,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":964},"output_tokens":55,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce88d08d-e354-48ee-a9e8-a33d7aea2b51","uuid":"15925abb-4411-4dab-a7c4-711d22655102","request_id":"req_011CbvjjQrhhQX4YzEmn5mUk"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CgNGWJqwsTaxQG63U7jDcf","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce88d08d-e354-48ee-a9e8-a33d7aea2b51","uuid":"1ca8431c-7383-474b-b790-c6c4c10d62da","timestamp":"2026-06-11T03:09:32.458Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"## sos_57 — Mana Sculpt","newString":"## sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone\n- \"Cast a copy from exile\" (Paradigm) is implemented by shallow-copying the\n  exiled original, marking it `_is_paradigm_copy` (so it skips Paradigm setup\n  and isn't re-exiled), and free-casting it from exile. The original stays in\n  exile as the permanent home; copies go to the graveyard. Reuses the\n  `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` seam (added for sos_1) to exile the\n  original instead of sending it to the graveyard.\n- \"First main phase\" = your precombat main; the recurring trigger fires on E2\n  whenever you're the active player (recurring, never unregisters).\n\n## sos_57 — Mana Sculpt","originalFile":"# KEY_DECISIONS — SOS implementation run\n\nLightweight log of ambiguities, deviations from TODO.md, and deliberate\ncard-local engine limitations.\n\n## sos_57 — Mana Sculpt\n- Added `card.mana_spent` (effective cost cmc) at cast time in `cast_spell`,\n  the \"amount of mana spent to cast\" a spell (parallels `colors_spent`).\n- \"If you control a Wizard\" is checked at the delayed trigger's FIRE time\n  (your next precombat main), per TODO — not at Mana Sculpt's resolution.\n  Delayed mana rides on E2; it self-unregisters after one payout.\n- \"Your next main phase\" is modeled as your next precombat main (E2 only\n  fires there). Casting it during the opponent's turn pays out next turn;\n  casting earlier in your own turn pays at that turn's precombat main entry.\n\n## sos_257 — Great Hall of the Biblioplex\n- Restricted mana (gap): added a separate `_restricted` track to `ManaPool`\n  plus an `allow_restricted` flag on `can_pay`/`pay`; `cast_spell` passes it\n  based on whether the spell is an instant/sorcery. Ability costs (the {5})\n  pay with `allow_restricted=False`, since activating an ability is not\n  \"casting a spell\". Unrestricted mana is spent before restricted.\n- Animation (gap): the land mutates in place (adds CREATURE type, Wizard\n  subtype, base 2/4, registers the pump trigger). `_reset_characteristics`\n  is overridden to NOT call super (which would de-animate by reverting\n  card_types) and to reset only the until-EOT pump. The EOT pump reset rides\n  on `EffectManager.apply_all`, which the engine runs during cleanup.\n- P/T while animated is exposed via `power`/`toughness` properties that\n  return 0 when not a creature (so a non-animated land isn't a combatant).\n\n## sos_226 — Silverquill, the Disputant\n- Casualty copy keeps the original spell's targets (the \"you may choose new\n  targets\" option is not prompted) — deliberate simplification; the copy\n  mechanic itself is faithful and the copy is correctly not re-cast (E1 does\n  not re-fire for copies).\n\n## sos_1 — The Dawning Archaic\n- Engine gap: `_resolve_spell` never consulted replacement effects for a\n  spell going stack→graveyard, and `AttacksTriggeredEvent` was defined but\n  never fired. Added both as small additive engine changes: a new\n  `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` consulted in `_resolve_spell`, and\n  per-attacker `AttacksTriggeredEvent` firing in `declare_attackers_step`.\n  Both are general (reusable) wirings of pre-existing event types, not a\n  one-card subsystem.\n- The \"may cast\" attack trigger auto-selects when exactly one legal target\n  exists (per TODO); with multiple, the controller chooses (None declines).\n  Declining a single legal target is not modeled — deliberate per plan.\n- The exile-instead replacement is one-shot, scoped to the specific spell\n  object, and self-unregisters when it fires. A countered free-cast spell\n  (which bypasses `_resolve_spell`) would not be redirected — edge case left\n  as a deliberate limitation.\n\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":3,"oldLines":6,"newStart":3,"newLines":16,"lines":[" Lightweight log of ambiguities, deviations from TODO.md, and deliberate"," card-local engine limitations."," ","+## sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone","+- \"Cast a copy from exile\" (Paradigm) is implemented by shallow-copying the","+  exiled original, marking it `_is_paradigm_copy` (so it skips Paradigm setup","+  and isn't re-exiled), and free-casting it from exile. The original stays in","+  exile as the permanent home; copies go to the graveyard. Reuses the","+  `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` seam (added for sos_1) to exile the","+  original instead of sending it to the graveyard.","+- \"First main phase\" = your precombat main; the recurring trigger fires on E2","+  whenever you're the active player (recurring, never unregisters).","+"," ## sos_57 — Mana Sculpt"," - Added `card.mana_spent` (effective cost cmc) at cast time in `cast_spell`,","   the \"amount of mana spent to cast\" a spell (parallels `colors_spent`)."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
