{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01HNnBYaWKagnmRd6eccDf9L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All ten SOS cards are implemented, tested, and committed — working tree clean. Here's the final state.\n\n## Summary\n\nAll 13 checklist items complete. Final suite: **1258 passed** (1145 engine regression, 74 new SOS tests, 39 FDN reference — no regressions).\n\n**Shared engine seams (built first, reused across cards):**\n- **E1** — fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` in `cast_spell` (sos_226, sos_257)\n- **E2** — `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent`, fired from `advance_phase` after emptying pools (sos_57, sos_120)\n- **E3** — aggregate `spell_cost_reduction` from battlefield permanents (sos_245)\n\n**The ten cards:**\n| Card | Mechanics |\n|---|---|\n| sos_4 Together as One | Converge (colors-spent → draw/damage/life) |\n| sos_1 The Dawning Archaic | cost reduction, attack-trigger free-cast, exile-instead replacement |\n| sos_245 Witherbloom | affinity self + granted via E3 |\n| sos_226 Silverquill | casualty 1 via E1 + `copy_spell` |\n| sos_257 Great Hall | land: 2 mana abilities (one restricted), {5} animation + pump |\n| sos_57 Mana Sculpt | counter + delayed Wizard mana via E2 |\n| sos_120 Improvisation Capstone | exile-cast + recurring Paradigm |\n| sos_13 Emeritus // Swords | ETB token, prepared state, cast-from-exile |\n| sos_201 Lorehold | miracle (turn-stamped) + opponent-upkeep loot |\n| sos_97 Ral Zarek | planeswalker: surveil / discard / reanimate / coin-flip skip-turns |\n\n**Additive engine changes** (all additive, `engine_tests/` stays green): the two E-events; `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` wired into `_resolve_spell`; `AttacksTriggeredEvent` firing in `declare_attackers_step`; `card.mana_spent` recorded at cast; restricted-mana support in `ManaPool`; loyalty/activated-ability `targets` → `chosen_targets`; `GameState.rng`; and skip-turns handling in `advance_phase`.\n\nPer-card decisions, ambiguities, and deliberate card-local limitations are logged in `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md`. Each card has its own `tests.py` driven through the real engine (`cast_spell`, `declare_attackers`, `advance_to_phase`, `activate_ability`, `resolve_top`), plus an independent spec-derived smoke check beyond the written tests for every card.\n\nOne judgment call worth flagging: sos_13's custom \"prepared\" keyword has no rulebook entry and its reminder text doesn't state \"without paying its mana cost\" — I followed the build plan's explicit free-cast design (`cast_spell_free`), since for a wholly-custom mechanic the designer's intent governs. It's noted in KEY_DECISIONS if you'd prefer it cost {W} instead."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":762,"cache_read_input_tokens":425721,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":762},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce88d08d-e354-48ee-a9e8-a33d7aea2b51","uuid":"e443a8a6-cc7e-4235-bf3c-0a1b27dd307f","request_id":"req_011CbvkwcE25nviESrnfCcRi"}
